  "subject": {
    "id": "cc000-local-ci-scaffold",
    "type": "DOCUMENT"
  },
  "summary": "Bind the fixed local CI scaffold and strict research TDD gate.",
  "why": "The three-commit implementation and correction history replaces repeated workflow command lists with one fixed local runner, makes future research tests enter a dedicated nonduplicated stage, strengthens exact TDD evidence ordering before any research integration state, and keeps document-drift tests valid across append-only revisions. This revision reserves only three new overseer files, preserves the historical authority anchor and sealed snapshot, starts no R stage, and changes no compiler semantics, runtime, release policy, hook installation, public API, or graph."
